"Sends the action, its source passages, the meeting notes, and what Muse reads from your meetings to api.meta.ai. Nothing is sent to anyone until you approve a step, and approved steps open as drafts. %@ so far." = "Yana aika matakin, sassan da ya fito daga ciki, bayanin kula na taro, da abin da Muse ya karanta daga tarukanka zuwa api.meta.ai. Ba a aika wa kowa komai ba sai ka amince da wani mataki, kuma matakan da ka amince da su suna buɗewa a matsayin daftari. %@ zuwa yanzu.";
