"Meta Muse" = "Meta Muse";
"Allow sending meeting text to https://api.meta.ai" = "Bari a aika rubutun taro zuwa https://api.meta.ai";
"Live Radar sends new live transcript lines, the meeting title, invited names, and passages from your earlier meetings that local search found, while it runs. Follow-through sends the action, its source passages, the meeting summary, your name from Settings → Writing, and what its tools read. Audio stays on this Mac unless you turn on fast live text, and voices and calendar email addresses always do. The same approval covers Think if you point it at this server." = "Yayin da Radar kai tsaye ke aiki, yana aika sababbin layukan rubutun magana kai tsaye, taken taro, sunayen waɗanda aka gayyata, da sassa daga tarukanka na baya da binciken gida ya samo. Aiwatarwa tana aika matakin, sassan da ya fito daga ciki, taƙaitawar taro, sunanka daga Saituna → Rubutu, da abin da kayan aikinta suka karanta. Sauti yana nan a wannan Mac sai dai idan ka kunna rubutu mai sauri kai tsaye, kuma bayanan murya da adireshin imel na kalanda koyaushe suna nan. Amincewar ɗaya ta shafi Tunani idan ka nuna shi ga wannan sabar.";
"Fast live text: send meeting audio to Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0" = "Rubutu mai sauri kai tsaye: aika sautin taro zuwa Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0";
"While the live transcript preview runs, streams the microphone and call audio to Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0, which returns each turn's text about a second after it ends. Without it, the preview transcribes 12-second chunks on this Mac. Who said what still comes from your microphone and the call track, never from Muse. Costs about $0.36 per meeting hour for the two tracks." = "Yayin da samfotin rubutun magana kai tsaye ke aiki, yana tura sautin makirufo da na kira zuwa Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0, wanda ke mayar da rubutun kowace juyar magana kusan daƙiƙa ɗaya bayan ta ƙare. Idan babu shi, samfoti yana rubuta gutsure na daƙiƙa 12 a wannan Mac. Wanda ya faɗi me har yanzu yana fitowa daga makirufonka da hanyar sautin kira, ba daga Muse ba. Kuɗinsa kusan $0.36 ne a kowace awa ta taro don hanyoyin sauti biyun.";
"Answer meeting questions from your screen" = "Amsa tambayoyin taro daga allonka";
"When Live Radar catches a question, LokalBot searches your screen memory on this Mac for captures that mention it, crops each to the rows that do, and sends up to three crops with their app, window title, and time to Muse Spark. An answer is shown only when its quote is in the crop's own text. Whole screenshots and the search stay on this Mac." = "Idan Radar kai tsaye ya kama tambaya, LokalBot yana bincika ƙwaƙwalwar allonka a wannan Mac don hotunan da suka ambace ta, yana yanke kowanne zuwa layukan da suka ambace ta, kuma yana aika har guntu uku tare da manhajarsu, taken taga, da lokaci zuwa Muse Spark. Ana nuna amsa ne kawai idan abin da ta ambato yana cikin rubutun guntun da kansa. Cikakkun hotunan allo da binciken suna nan a wannan Mac.";
"Live Radar model" = "Samfurin Radar kai tsaye";
"Follow-through model" = "Samfurin aiwatarwa";
"Fast. About 3 s per radar pass." = "Mai sauri. Kusan daƙiƙa 3 a kowane zagayen radar.";
"Strongest reasoning and tool use. About 6 s per radar pass." = "Mafi ƙarfin tunani da amfani da kayan aiki. Kusan daƙiƙa 6 a kowane zagayen radar.";
"Plans the work for one action and proposes drafts, invites, and handoffs. Nothing is sent or created until you approve it." = "Yana tsara aikin mataki ɗaya kuma yana ba da shawarar daftari, gayyata, da miƙa aiki. Ba a aika ko ƙirƙirar komai ba sai ka amince.";
"Meta's terms for your Model API account apply. Content sent while you use free credits may be used to improve Meta's products, so record only people who agreed." = "Sharuɗɗan Meta na asusun Model API ɗinka suna aiki. Abubuwan da aka aika yayin da kake amfani da kiredit na kyauta za a iya amfani da su don inganta kayayyakin Meta, don haka ka yi rikodin mutanen da suka amince kawai.";
"Meta Model API key" = "Maɓallin Meta Model API";
"Create a key at dev.meta.ai" = "Ƙirƙiri maɓalli a dev.meta.ai";
"Using Think's key for api.meta.ai." = "Ana amfani da maɓallin Tunani don api.meta.ai.";
"Couldn’t save the key to Keychain. Try again." = "An kasa adana maɓallin a Keychain. Sake gwadawa.";
"Fast live text with Muse Voice Transcribe" = "Rubutu mai sauri kai tsaye da Muse Voice Transcribe";
"Add a Meta Model API key in Settings → Meetings → Meta Muse." = "Ƙara maɓallin Meta Model API a Saituna → Taruka → Meta Muse.";
"Allow LokalBot to send meeting text to api.meta.ai in Settings → Meetings → Meta Muse." = "Bari LokalBot ya aika rubutun taro zuwa api.meta.ai a Saituna → Taruka → Meta Muse.";
