"Show the floating Live Radar panel during meetings" = "Nuna tagar Radar kai tsaye mai shawagi yayin taruka";
"A small window over your meeting app with what Live Radar catches. It opens when a recording starts, with Start Radar in it, and never takes focus from the call." = "Ƙaramar taga a kan manhajar taronka da ke nuna abin da Radar kai tsaye ke kamawa. Tana buɗewa idan rikodi ya fara, da maɓallin “Fara Radar” a cikinta, kuma ba ta taɓa zama tagar da ake aiki da ita a maimakon kiran ba.";
"Hide the floating panel from screen sharing and recordings" = "Ɓoye tagar mai shawagi yayin raba allo da cikin rikodi";
"Others in the call don't see the panel when you share your screen. Turn this off to include it in a screen recording." = "Sauran mutane a kiran ba sa ganin tagar idan ka raba allonka. Kashe wannan don saka ta cikin rikodin allo.";
"Answer from your work" = "Amsa daga aikinka";
"Add Folder…" = "Ƙara babban fayil…";
"Answer questions from your work during calls" = "Amsa tambayoyi daga aikinka yayin kira";
"Folders and repositories it may read" = "Manyan fayiloli da ma'ajiyoyin da zai iya karantawa";
"Live answers model" = "Samfurin amsoshi kai tsaye";
"Muse Wonder reasons through lookups more carefully; Muse Spark answers sooner." = "Muse Wonder yana tunani sosai kafin ya nema; Muse Spark yana amsawa da sauri.";
"When Live Radar catches a question or a problem, Muse looks for the answer in your work: first what LokalBot remembers (your projects and where they stand, your open actions, what you told it about yourself), then your meetings, what you saw on screen, and the folders below. It sends Muse the question, the last few lines, what it remembers that bears on it, and the parts of meetings, screen text, documents, and code it reads. An answer is shown only when its sources contain the words it quotes." = "Idan Radar kai tsaye (Live Radar) ya kama tambaya ko matsala, Muse yana neman amsar a cikin aikinka: da farko abin da LokalBot ya tuna (ayyukanka da inda suka kai, matakanka da ke buɗe, da abin da ka gaya masa game da kanka), sannan tarukanka, abin da ka gani a allo, da manyan fayilolin da ke ƙasa. Yana aika wa Muse tambayar, layukan ƙarshe, abin da ya tuna wanda ya shafe ta, da sassan taruka, rubutun allo, takardu, da lambar da ya karanta. Ana nuna amsa ne kawai idan tushenta yana ɗauke da kalmomin da take ambato.";
"Documents, sheets, and PDFs in these folders can be read. In a git repository it also reads tracked code, recent commits, and pull requests and issues through the GitHub CLI. Hidden files, untracked files, and secrets such as .env files and keys are never read." = "Ana iya karanta takardu, falle-falle, da PDF a cikin waɗannan manyan fayilolin. A cikin ma'ajiyar git, yana kuma karanta lambar da ake bibiya, kwanan nan commits, da pull requests da matsaloli ta GitHub CLI. Ba a taɓa karanta fayiloli ɓoyayyu, fayilolin da ba a bibiya ba, da sirrika kamar fayilolin .env da makullai.";
